{"name": "AIRSKIPPER", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras_big/e64f086d364c17b785e1c1dfd787e8c2.webp?t=1786516827\" height=\"254\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/e64f086d364c17b785e1c1dfd787e8c2.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AIRSKIPPER</strong> is a game about speeding through linear stages to reach the goal fast while maintaining a combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLASH</strong> your way through enemies or hit objects to launch yourself with recoil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DASH</strong> through objects and enemies to cover lots of distance quickly, carrying your momentum past your target!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your best to find the most optimal path for the highest combo and fastest time to get the highest scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"242\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/64b4eff3f78ffadb3ced5b82abf527d9.poster.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/64b4eff3f78ffadb3ced5b82abf527d9.webm?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/64b4eff3f78ffadb3ced5b82abf527d9.mp4?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"242\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/9f5ce543c75525d31c0d49905d51024f.poster.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/9f5ce543c75525d31c0d49905d51024f.webm?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/9f5ce543c75525d31c0d49905d51024f.mp4?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combo Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hitting enemies and most objects will build up your combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Touching the ground will cause your combo timer to count down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure to hit something before it expires, or you will lose your combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/a5cc5e741a5d44131c4599f30da35d19.poster.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"442\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/a5cc5e741a5d44131c4599f30da35d19.webm?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/a5cc5e741a5d44131c4599f30da35d19.mp4?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Score Ranking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score is based on your combo, your number of deaths, how many enemies you defeated and the time taken to complete the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay stages to see how close you are or how much you exceeded your personal best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/7272a62543a94e95a0393839d342d747.poster.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/7272a62543a94e95a0393839d342d747.webm?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/7272a62543a94e95a0393839d342d747.mp4?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stage Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own stages and share them with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage builder has a variety of enemies and objects, allowing you to create your own tough challenges or silly experiences for others to enjoy (or suffer through).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/b8b93c39d43cb44bcc6e223580f36ead.poster.avif?t=1786516827\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/b8b93c39d43cb44bcc6e223580f36ead.webm?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/extras/b8b93c39d43cb44bcc6e223580f36ead.mp4?t=1786516827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Run through stages in this fast-paced action precision platformer. Rack up a combo and maintain it throughout the stage to score big at the end, or create your own stages and share them with others!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731440/70e5dfc9c1f6fa51211e049d32ddf3b9184b1f68/header.jpg?t=1786516827", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Platformer", "2D Platformer", "Precision Platformer", "2D", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Team Hartlock", "publishers": "Team Hartlock", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4731440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "11 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/RAtHPh_Rj-c", "first_seen": 1786399200.0, "review_rank": 143}